{"src":"en","tgt":"ur","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":165000,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"ur","src":"en","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"nonprofit","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":7947.9082339999995,"text":"The Shenzhen zone however works somewhat like one country in this respect."},{"kind":"text","t":9675.941964,"text":"تاہم، اس لحاظ سے شنزین کا علاقہ کسی حد تک ایک ملک کی طرح کام کرتا ہے۔"},{"kind":"audio","t":9810.54151,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":280,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9815.3854,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":9820.403096999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":250,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9825.798907999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1250},{"kind":"audio","t":9826.217510999999,"samples":445,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":15111.044297999999,"text":"Resting on the top of one of the mountains north of Mecca, the cave is closely"},{"kind":"text","t":17226.22742,"text":"مکہ کے شمال میں واقع پہاڑوں میں سے ایک کی چوٹی پر واقع یہ غار بہت قریب ہے۔"},{"kind":"audio","t":17327.890030000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":230,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":17332.603942,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":17337.822806,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":17341.78803,"samples":23739,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":870},{"kind":"input","t":17737.52191,"text":"isolated from the rest of the world."},{"kind":"text","t":18750.504448,"text":"دنیا کے باقی حصوں سے الگ تھلگ ہے۔"},{"kind":"audio","t":18818.678161,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":18824.054362000003,"samples":32712,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1190},{"kind":"input","t":26275.453232,"text":"People now write messages on computer screens never having to come close to a sharpener."},{"kind":"text","t":29486.745719000002,"text":"لوگ اب کمپیوٹر کی سکرینوں پر پیغامات لکھتے ہیں، انہیں کبھی بھی کاغذ تیز کرنے والے آلے کے قریب جانے کی ضرورت نہیں پڑتی۔"},{"kind":"audio","t":29635.158496,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":29636.413155000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":29637.851162000003,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":29639.479534000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":29641.074958,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":29642.668772,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":29643.106765,"samples":10978,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":290},{"kind":"input","t":37524.927111,"text":"Travelers bound for countries with heavy taxation can sometimes save a considerable amount of money, especially on products such as alcoholic beverages and tobacco."},{"kind":"text","t":41200.362435999996,"text":"ان ممالک کا رخ کرنے والے مسافر جہاں ٹیکس کی شرح زیادہ ہے، وہ کبھی کبھی نمایاں مقدار میں رقم بچا سکتے ہیں، خاص طور پر الکحلی مشروبات اور تمباکو جیسی اشیاء پر۔"},{"kind":"audio","t":41429.909853,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":450,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":41433.015971,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":41436.307566999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":41439.535314,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":41442.913638,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":41446.39671,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":41449.633077,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":41452.937112,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":41456.310075999994,"samples":32656,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1250},{"kind":"input","t":45771.917222,"text":"Plants make their food from the sun by photosynthesis. They also provide shade."},{"kind":"text","t":47673.264037999994,"text":"پودے فوٹوسنتھیسس کے ذریعے سورج سے اپنا خوراک تیار کرتے ہیں۔ وہ سایہ بھی فراہم کرتے ہیں۔"},{"kind":"audio","t":47802.535340999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":220,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":47807.508688999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":47812.579135,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":47818.368129999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":47822.833556,"samples":26916,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":970},{"kind":"input","t":58051.122522,"text":"The hospital has followed protocol for infection control, including separating the patient from others to prevent possible infection of others."},{"kind":"text","t":61830.420581,"text":"ہسپتال نے انفیکشن کنٹرول کے لیے مقرر کردہ ضوابط پر عمل کیا ہے، جس میں دیگر افراد کو ممکنہ انفیکشن سے بچانے کے لیے مریض کو الگ رکھنا بھی شامل ہے۔"},{"kind":"audio","t":62021.368525,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":210,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":62026.52113,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":62031.820282,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":62036.979667,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":62042.220689999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":62047.419264,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":62051.954899,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":62055.250595,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1240},{"kind":"audio","t":62055.52905,"samples":55,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":68161.435087,"text":"The work done was mostly theoretical, but the program was written to simulate observations made of the Sagittarius galaxy."},{"kind":"text","t":71534.077707,"text":"جو کام انجام دیا گیا وہ زیادہ تر نظریاتی تھا، لیکن یہ پروگرام سگیٹیریئس کہکشاں سے کیے گئے مشاہدات کی نقل کرنے کے لیے تخلیق کیا گیا تھا۔"},{"kind":"audio","t":71715.298052,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":210,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":71719.90834600001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":71725.258418,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":71730.374633,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":71735.569757,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":71740.980268,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":71745.405685,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":71747.28248400001,"samples":20842,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":760},{"kind":"input","t":78291.21536100001,"text":"Barcelona's official languages are Catalan and Spanish. About half prefer to speak Catalan, a vast majority understands it, and virtually everyone knows Spanish."},{"kind":"text","t":82410.49601100001,"text":"بارسلونا کی سرکاری زبانیں کیٹالان اور ہسپانوی ہیں۔ تقریباً آدھے لوگ کیٹالان زبان بولنا پسند کرتے ہیں، اسے سمجھنے والوں کی تعداد بہت زیادہ ہے، اور تقریباً ہر کوئی ہسپانوی زبان جانتا ہے۔"},{"kind":"audio","t":82653.712652,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":130,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":82658.973235,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":82664.70719,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":82669.942563,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":82675.280045,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":82680.540728,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":82684.588141,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":82687.868537,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":82690.936757,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":82693.785699,"samples":28031,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1040},{"kind":"input","t":83784.89849600001,"text":"In some areas, boiling water for a minute is enough and other several minutes are needed."},{"kind":"text","t":86399.675312,"text":"کچھ علاقوں میں پانی کو ایک منٹ تک ابالنا کافی ہے، جبکہ دیگر علاقوں میں کئی منٹوں کی ضرورت ہوتی ہے۔"},{"kind":"audio","t":86542.328884,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":620,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":86547.279662,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":86552.780281,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1170},{"kind":"audio","t":86558.208612,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":310,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":86563.17187,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":86567.687755,"samples":32043,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1190},{"kind":"input","t":89845.974474,"text":"Plants look their best when in a natural environment, so resist the temptation to remove even just one stem."},{"kind":"text","t":92725.74903,"text":"پودے قدرتی ماحول میں سب سے بہترین حالت میں نظر آتے ہیں، اس لیے صرف ایک ہی تنہ ہٹانے کی خواہش پر قابو رکھیں۔"},{"kind":"audio","t":92902.40285,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":440,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92907.635844,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92912.77098900001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92917.715157,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92922.931821,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92928.235253,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92928.987691,"samples":6520,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":160},{"kind":"input","t":97260.033011,"text":"During the 1920s, the prevailing attitudes of most citizens and nations was that of pacifism and isolation."},{"kind":"text","t":99740.431717,"text":"1920 کی دہائی میں، زیادہ تر شہریوں اور اقوام کا غالب رویہ پرامنیت پسندی اور تنہائی پسندی کا تھا۔"},{"kind":"audio","t":99870.74697400001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":240,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":99875.763411,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":99880.865546,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":99886.129069,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":99891.363383,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":99891.770386,"samples":5294,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":90},{"kind":"input","t":103516.049667,"text":"Masa Serif was the apex predator of its time, so it feared nothing except other Mosul"},{"kind":"text","t":106433.41427200001,"text":"ماسا سیریف اپنے دور کا سب سے خطرناک شکاری تھا، اس لیے اسے صرف دوسرے موصل جانوروں کے علاوہ کسی چیز سے ڈر نہیں تھا۔"},{"kind":"audio","t":106587.65120200001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":210,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":106592.772748,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":106597.989312,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":106603.18984600001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":106608.598626,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":106613.685022,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":106615.142208,"samples":10421,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":270},{"kind":"input","t":113122.21605500001,"text":"Since the foundation of Asuncion in 1537, Paraguay has managed to keep a lot of its indigenous character and identity."},{"kind":"text","t":116327.78063600001,"text":"1537 میں اسونسیون کی بنیاد رکھے جانے کے بعد سے، پیراگوئے اپنی بہت سی مقامی خصوصیات اور شناخت کو برقرار رکھنے میں کامیاب رہا ہے۔"},{"kind":"audio","t":116512.329356,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":210,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":116517.17217600001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":116522.568237,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":116527.66124300001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":116532.707249,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":116537.907533,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":116543.105978,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":116544.505464,"samples":15826,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":540},{"kind":"input","t":119857.26365400001,"text":"The disease is carried by pigs, which then migrates to humans through mosquitoes."},{"kind":"text","t":122368.40035200001,"text":"یہ بیماری سوروں کے ذریعے پھیلتی ہے، اور پھر مچھروں کے ذریعے انسانوں تک پہنچتی ہے۔"},{"kind":"audio","t":122501.812097,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":122507.164869,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1180},{"kind":"audio","t":122512.194136,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":122517.516628,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":122520.09048500001,"samples":16885,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":560},{"kind":"input","t":129344.70386400001,"text":"Most modern research telescopes are enormous facilities in remote areas with favorable atmospheric conditions."},{"kind":"text","t":131796.820007,"text":"زیادہ تر جدید تحقیقی دوربینیں، سازگار فضائی حالات والے دور دراز علاقوں میں واقع بہت بڑے تنصیبات ہیں۔"},{"kind":"audio","t":131938.999018,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":270,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":131944.041114,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":131949.14859,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":260,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":131954.394213,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":131959.658446,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":131964.29854999998,"samples":28978,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1060},{"kind":"input","t":135212.971338,"text":"People may not anticipate that patience and understanding are also necessary for travelers"},{"kind":"text","t":137258.93760399998,"text":"لوگ شاید یہ توقع نہ کریں کہ مسافروں کے لیے صبر اور سمجھ بوجھ بھی ضروری ہے۔"},{"kind":"audio","t":137363.757402,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":500,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":137368.85865799998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":137374.17676,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":137379.39779299998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":137379.665289,"samples":3510,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":10},{"kind":"input","t":140529.913145,"text":"So it is likely that the notation was added simply as a label."},{"kind":"text","t":142460.04923499998,"text":"لہٰذا یہ ممکن ہے کہ یہ نشان صرف ایک لیبل کے طور پر شامل کیا گیا ہو۔"},{"kind":"audio","t":142553.988232,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":142558.820102,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":142564.24428299998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":142567.102826,"samples":17609,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":620},{"kind":"input","t":147759.28765399999,"text":"But there are a lot of things about birds that still look like a dinosaur."},{"kind":"text","t":149888.11388999998,"text":"لیکن پرندوں سے متعلق بہت سی چیزیں اب بھی ڈائنوسار جیسی دکھائی دیتی ہیں۔"},{"kind":"audio","t":149993.702525,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":280,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":149998.809911,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":150003.897497,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":110,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":150009.100041,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":150009.549993,"samples":5182,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":100},{"kind":"input","t":154945.136122,"text":"They are almost all sandy beaches with safe swimming and most have shade provided by"},{"kind":"text","t":157789.98306499998,"text":"وہ تقریباً سبھی ریتیلے ساحل ہیں جہاں تیرنا محفوظ ہے، اور زیادہ تر کے پاس سایہ فراہم کرنے والے درخت موجود ہیں۔"},{"kind":"audio","t":157927.574871,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":210,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":157929.093826,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":157930.520283,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":157932.13770599998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":157933.71399999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":157934.856431,"samples":24798,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":910},{"kind":"input","t":158123.486913,"text":"Pohican trees."},{"kind":"text","t":158566.928285,"text":"پوہیکن درخت۔"},{"kind":"audio","t":158600.55200899998,"samples":28421,"rate":24000,"on":190,"off":1060},{"kind":"input","t":164332.768532,"text":"Duvall, who is married with two adult children, did not leave a big impression on Miller, to whom the story was related."},{"kind":"text","t":167577.122442,"text":"ڈوول، جو شادی شدہ ہیں اور ان کے دو بالغ بچے ہیں، نے ملر پر کوئی خاص تأثر نہیں چھوڑا، جنہیں یہ کہانی سنائی گئی تھی۔"},{"kind":"audio","t":167722.83728399998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":210,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":167724.125952,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":167725.692647,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1030},{"kind":"audio","t":167727.14330199998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":100,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":167728.80791499998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":167730.419368,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":167730.560096,"samples":6241,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":140},{"kind":"close","t":177805.183472,"code":1005}]}